sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant Gateway as Gateway API<br/>HTTPRoute
    participant KRBAC as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP TLS
    participant Backend as Node.js Backend<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant BFF as Go BFF Sidecar<br/>(gen-ai, maas, etc.)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Downstream as Downstream Service<br/>(Pipelines, KServe, etc.)

    Note over User,Downstream: Flow 1: SPA Load & Authentication
    User->>Gateway: GET / (HTTPS)
    Gateway->>KRBAC: Forward to :8443 (TLS)
    KRBAC->>KRBAC: Validate OpenShift project access
    KRBAC->>Backend: Forward to :8080 (HTTP)
    Backend-->>KRBAC: React SPA + static assets
    KRBAC-->>Gateway: Response (TLS)
    Gateway-->>User: HTML/JS/CSS

    Note over User,Downstream: Flow 2: API Proxy Request (e.g., list notebooks)
    User->>KRBAC: GET /api/k8s/apis/kubeflow.org/v1/notebooks<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    KRBAC->>KRBAC: Validate token + project access
    KRBAC->>Backend: Forward (x-forwarded-access-token)
    Backend->>K8sAPI: Impersonated K8s request<br/>Auth: User token impersonation
    K8sAPI-->>Backend: Notebook list (JSON)
    Backend-->>KRBAC: Response
    KRBAC-->>User: JSON Response

    Note over User,Downstream: Flow 3: Service Proxy (e.g., DataScience Pipelines)
    User->>KRBAC: GET /api/service/pipelines/*<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    KRBAC->>Backend: Forward with user token
    Backend->>Backend: CRD-based service discovery<br/>(DSPipelineKind status field)
    Backend->>Downstream: Proxy to DSP API :8443<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (TLS)
    Downstream-->>Backend: Pipeline data (JSON)
    Backend-->>KRBAC: Response
    KRBAC-->>User: JSON Response

    Note over User,Downstream: Flow 4: BFF API Request (e.g., gen-ai chat)
    User->>KRBAC: POST /gen-ai/api/v1/chat<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    KRBAC->>BFF: Forward to gen-ai BFF :8143<br/>(x-forwarded-access-token)
    BFF->>BFF: RequireAccessToService middleware<br/>RBAC + namespace validation
    BFF->>K8sAPI: SubjectAccessReview<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>BFF: Allowed
    BFF->>Downstream: LLM inference request<br/>Auth: Bearer Token / API Key (TLS)
    Downstream-->>BFF: Inference response
    BFF-->>KRBAC: Response
    KRBAC-->>User: JSON Response

    Note over User,Downstream: Flow 5: WebSocket Watch
    User->>KRBAC: UPGRADE /wss/k8s/*<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    KRBAC->>Backend: WebSocket upgrade
    Backend->>K8sAPI: Watch request (WSS :6443)<br/>Auth: User token impersonation
    K8sAPI-->>Backend: Watch events (streaming)
    Backend-->>User: WebSocket events

    Note over User,Downstream: Flow 6: Module Federation Remote Entry
    User->>KRBAC: GET /_mf/model-registry/remoteEntry.js<br/>Auth: user_token
    KRBAC->>Backend: Forward to :8080
    Backend->>BFF: Proxy to model-registry-ui :8043
    BFF-->>Backend: Remote entry JS bundle
    Backend-->>KRBAC: Response
    KRBAC-->>User: JavaScript module
